  <main>
    <section class="hero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A small team working together at laptops" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past on">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>The way you work was built years ago. <em>We bring it up to date.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Fretwork connects the tools, workflows and AI your team already uses into one system that runs on its own. Your framing does not have to be your foundation.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Free 30-minute call. We tell you what is broken and what it would cost.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>30</b><span>Days to a working system</span></div><div><b>0</b><span>New tools to buy</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Human signs off on everything</span></div><div><b>Any</b><span>Works with the systems you already use</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="split" id="problem"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="A team mapping a process on a whiteboard"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Your team is the glue between tools that do not talk.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>You run on tools and habits someone else set up.</li><li>Nothing talks to anything. People copy and paste all day.</li><li>Nobody has written down how the work actually flows.</li></ul>
    </div></section>

    <section class="split rev alt" id="approach"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('/img/russ/russ-laptop.jpg');background-position:50% 10%" role="img" aria-label="Russ working on a laptop"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2>Look. Fix. Hand it off.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>We map how the work really flows before we change anything.</li><li>We connect what you have: your email, calendar, files, CRM and the apps your team already lives in.</li><li>We automate the busywork and add AI where it actually helps.</li><li>Your team runs it. No long contract.</li></ul>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/start">Start</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who it is for</p><h2>Three kinds of teams call us.</h2></div>
      <div class="pcards"><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two colleagues reviewing a dashboard" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Five to fifty people</span><b>The small business</b><em>Five to fifty people, drowning in spreadsheets and re-typing.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574572-cb89e39749b4?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A diverse team around a conference table" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Mission first</span><b>The nonprofit</b><em>Grant reports, boards and compliance on tools nobody set up on purpose.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292089-90a7e086ee0c?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two colleagues working through a plan at a laptop" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Intake to invoice</span><b>The professional practice</b><em>Law, advisory, real estate: intake to invoice without the hand-offs breaking.</em></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec" id="what"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Five things we build.</h2></div><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team planning at a whiteboard with sticky notes" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Workflows</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two people at a laptop reviewing a process" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Automations</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team working together at their computers" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>AI assistants</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A dashboard on a laptop screen" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Dashboards</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team walking through a plan together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Training</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="https://www.vaulthuman.com/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Who does the work</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years running organizations on whatever systems they had, as the person who had to make them work. Russ looks at how the work really flows before he changes anything.</p><blockquote>Every system you run today was built in the past. We start there.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start with a free call.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Look</h3><p>A 30-minute call. We map how your work flows today.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Fix</h3><p>A fixed price. We connect your tools and automate the busywork.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Hand off</h3><p>Your team runs it. We stay on only if you want us to.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="after"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What changes</p><h2>When it is done.</h2></div>
      <div class="after"><div><b>The re-typing stops.</b><p>Data moves on its own, once, correctly.</p></div><div><b>You can see the work.</b><p>One place shows what is in, what is stuck, and what is done.</p></div><div><b>Your team owns it.</b><p>Written down, handed over, and theirs.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Simple to start.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Systems Review</h3><div class="price price-word">Fixed fee</div><p>We look at every tool and hand-off and give you a plan you own.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a call</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Rebuild</h3><div class="price price-word">Quoted</div><p>We connect, automate and hand off. About 30 days.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Ongoing</div><h3>Keep it running</h3><div class="price price-word">Monthly</div><p>We watch it, fix it, and add to it as you grow.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Fixed prices, quoted after the call. No surprises.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">Fretwork is the pattern under the finish: the systems your work actually runs on. Fretwork is the systems company in the Vault Human family. On its own it modernizes how teams work. It is not coaching and not a law firm.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown me" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com"><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Modernizes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>Executive leadership, communication and high-performance coaching. Not a law firm.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet Law</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, probate and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Fretwork do?</summary><p>Modernizes how your work runs: connects your tools, automates busywork, adds AI where it helps, and hands it to your team.</p></details><details><summary>Do you replace our tools?</summary><p>No. We connect the ones you have.</p></details><details><summary>What do you build on?</summary><p>Whatever you already run. Microsoft, Google, Apple, your CRM, your inbox, the AI tools you pay for. We work with any system.</p></details><details><summary>Why 'the past'?</summary><p>Because every system you run today was built in the past. We start there.</p></details><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Daily coaching, run by the same owner. Fretwork is the systems side; it is not coaching.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A small team working together at laptops" loading="lazy" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>See what we see.</h2><p class="lede">A free 30-minute call. We tell you what is broken and what it would cost.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

